  "id": "baked-courgette-feta-and-halloumi",
  "name": "Baked Courgette, Feta, and Halloumi",
  "subtitle": "A herbed courgette bake with salty cheese and toasted seeds",
  "description": "Grated courgettes, fresh herbs, eggs, and two cheeses bake into a tender savory dish finished with sesame, nigella, and dill.",
